@host = http://localhost:5000

###Create Group
POST {{host}}/v1/api/groups HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "group": 
    {
    "name" : "TEAM DEV",
    "description" :"who is that",
    "status" : 1,
    "user_id" :"526c0b00-677d-11ee-8390-0242ac150004"
    }
  
}

###Update Group
